# Copy to .env at the repo root (gitignored) to enable the AI Assistant
# panel. Optional -- without this file the panel just shows "not configured"
# and the rest of the app works exactly the same. Loaded automatically on
# server startup via process.loadEnvFile() (see server/src/index.ts); no
# restart-free reload -- edit this file, then restart `npm run server`.
#
# All three are required together. AI_BASE_URL must be an OpenAI-compatible
# `/chat/completions` base (no trailing /chat/completions) -- pick one:
#   OpenRouter:        https://openrouter.ai/api/v1
#   Google AI Studio:  https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/openai
#   anything else that speaks the same wire format (a local Ollama, another
#   gateway) works too.
AI_API_KEY=
AI_BASE_URL=
# AI_MODEL is a comma-separated priority list -- the first model is tried
# first; if every attempt at a model fails (timeout, 4xx/5xx, network error)
# it's put on a 15-minute cooldown and the next model in the list is tried.
# Once a model's cooldown expires, later requests try it again from the top.
# A single model (no comma) works exactly as before.
#   AI_MODEL=google/gemma-4-31b-it:free,google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free,openrouter/free
AI_MODEL=
